            {
                "entry_id": "af705573-2f63-3aeb-9c7d-0ca017594416",
                "word": "comma",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "951ed5c8-fd9c-4824-af33-d8afe2cc5b0f",
                        "entry_id": "af705573-2f63-3aeb-9c7d-0ca017594416",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "commas"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "02864322-3146-3b35-9f0b-ad6e51ba4c0c",
                        "entry_id": "af705573-2f63-3aeb-9c7d-0ca017594416",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Faible quantité qui s’exprime par une fraction arithmétique, généralement rationnelle, dont la valeur est relativement proche de l’unité."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "55a999f0-987c-4625-8f93-43f948bd7eac",
                                "sense_id": "02864322-3146-3b35-9f0b-ad6e51ba4c0c",
                                "text": "Le comma enharmonique des musicologues a une valeur de 128/125."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "8e3a257e-cf32-4059-a9f5-8cd92dd5dc90",
                                "sense_id": "02864322-3146-3b35-9f0b-ad6e51ba4c0c",
                                "text": "Le comma syntonique et le comma pythagoricien des musicologues font respectivement, 81/80 et 3¹²/2¹⁹."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "9eeba0eb-6aee-3d63-831e-82bffc0918a8",
                        "entry_id": "af705573-2f63-3aeb-9c7d-0ca017594416",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Huitième ou neuvième partie d’un ton, à peu près la moitié d’un quart de ton."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "6b6a1ddf-1a2e-4c5c-ab1f-dda26bbf90b2",
                                "sense_id": "9eeba0eb-6aee-3d63-831e-82bffc0918a8",
                                "text": "La valeur du comma n’est appréciable que par le calcul."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "06f23af8-87ef-498a-8513-d2d5de7945e7",
                                "sense_id": "9eeba0eb-6aee-3d63-831e-82bffc0918a8",
                                "text": "Petit malheureux, tu ne sais donc pas ce que c’est qu’un comma, ce huitième de ton qui différencie le ré dièze du mi bémol, le la dièze du si bémol, et autres ? Ah ça ! est-ce que personne ici n’est capable d’apprécier des huitièmes de ton !"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "94b1fa78-885d-3487-a19c-f9ef220e8c69",
                        "entry_id": "af705573-2f63-3aeb-9c7d-0ca017594416",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Ancien nom du deux-points."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "archaic"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "f770c82f-4b68-4ecc-9e32-eb3a268b24f4",
                                "sense_id": "94b1fa78-885d-3487-a19c-f9ef220e8c69",
                                "text": "Autrefois le comma (ou deux-points) se plaçait entre deux espaces égales. — (Henri Fournier, Traité de la typographie, 1826)"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "db881e25-f0dc-3862-84d0-6fec4c811e37",
                        "entry_id": "af705573-2f63-3aeb-9c7d-0ca017594416",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Papillon de jour de la famille des hespéridés (Hesperiidae), dont le dos les ailes sont de couleur brun-orange avec des points blancs nombreux sous les postérieures."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "66eee6ac-851e-47da-8474-c97d3221f19b",
                                "sense_id": "db881e25-f0dc-3862-84d0-6fec4c811e37",
                                "text": "La chenille du comma se nourrit sur des graminées."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "5c339bb2-027b-4a9f-a033-629d24244112",
                        "source_entry_id": "af705573-2f63-3aeb-9c7d-0ca017594416",
                        "source_sense_description": "intervalle musical",
                        "target_lang_word": "Komma",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Komma",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "92c82fec-5bff-3ae5-90b8-7066b209b2fa",
                                        "entry_id": "1f888a80-7367-3e98-be2e-8825f128a68e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Interpunktionszeichen, Satzzeichen"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Germany"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7cd56b35-152f-45fc-b790-b24cf656c4bc",
                                                "sense_id": "92c82fec-5bff-3ae5-90b8-7066b209b2fa",
                                                "text": "Aufzählungen werden in einem Satz durch Kommas abgetrennt."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f842cd92-84fb-4851-adb7-38d67e16f130",
                                                "sense_id": "92c82fec-5bff-3ae5-90b8-7066b209b2fa",
                                                "text": "„Im Bereich der Zeichensetzung ist die Verwendung des Kommas liberaler geregelt.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f255e7fb-e7e4-48bc-811e-f7c8088d2bd4",
                                                "sense_id": "92c82fec-5bff-3ae5-90b8-7066b209b2fa",
                                                "text": "„Kommata und oft auch Semikola zwischen Äquivalenten einer Bedeutungsangabe sind für Wörterbuchbenutzer insofern tückisch, weil sie nicht das signalisieren, was sprachüblich ist.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "99d359e0-f97b-492d-a1ff-df69ca61c621",
                                                "sense_id": "92c82fec-5bff-3ae5-90b8-7066b209b2fa",
                                                "text": "„Doch damals ging es nur um Versfüße und Kommas.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "78f7e239-e57d-426f-889e-ba90047596d0",
                                                "sense_id": "92c82fec-5bff-3ae5-90b8-7066b209b2fa",
                                                "text": "„Er zerpflückte jeden Satz, holte bei den Kommas Luft und verachtete die Punkte.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7ca73322-0c6b-4bec-98b1-08d9f8674239",
                                                "sense_id": "92c82fec-5bff-3ae5-90b8-7066b209b2fa",
                                                "text": "„Kommt im Englischen zwischen Haupt- und Nebensatz ein Komma?“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "50b2017a-2fc0-302c-9745-63e14ddb34ab",
                                        "entry_id": "1f888a80-7367-3e98-be2e-8825f128a68e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Trennzeichen in Dezimalzahlen"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Austrian German",
                                            "Germany"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fe111b6a-99c3-4c78-8b8a-b49d0580f126",
                                                "sense_id": "50b2017a-2fc0-302c-9745-63e14ddb34ab",
                                                "text": "Pi entspricht ungefähr der Zahl 3,14 (gesprochen: „drei Komma eins vier“)."
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"2\""
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1d340c2d-ae70-319a-bf4b-c8cbc75dfa93",
                                        "entry_id": "1f888a80-7367-3e98-be2e-8825f128a68e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "„kleinere rhythmische Unterteilung der Periode“"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Rhetorik"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b3b8bea2-28a7-4d63-bd54-a027416a3575",
                                                "sense_id": "1d340c2d-ae70-319a-bf4b-c8cbc75dfa93",
                                                "text": "Komma in diesem Sinne ist ein kurzer Sprechtakt, der einem Kolon, einer Sprech- und Sinneinheit, entsprechen kann; meist besteht ein Kolon aber aus mehr als nur einem Komma."
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"3\""
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7b893cbb-e09b-384b-9bcd-1ba690fc8820",
                                        "entry_id": "1f888a80-7367-3e98-be2e-8825f128a68e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "ein kleines Musikintervall als Pythagoreisches Komma"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Musik"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "143189bb-ff3a-421c-85b7-e28c936401c7",
                                                "sense_id": "7b893cbb-e09b-384b-9bcd-1ba690fc8820",
                                                "text": "„Praktische Relevanz erhält das Komma beim Stimmen von Instrumenten mit festen Tonhöhen. Darunter fallen zum Beispiel Tasteninstrumente sowie Saiteninstrumente mit Bünden.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"4\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "56fb2056-97e8-4c00-ae8b-0d467e63fd6a",
                        "source_entry_id": "af705573-2f63-3aeb-9c7d-0ca017594416",
                        "source_sense_description": "intervalle musical",
                        "target_lang_word": "comma",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "comma",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9f54ef25-5943-3114-b9f0-924307d33fd3",
                                        "entry_id": "90bc949d-a4b2-33fc-8765-1cd006073279",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The punctuation mark ⟨,⟩ used to indicate a set of parts of a sentence or between elements of a list."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c6d728b4-ebb9-4fc8-ab97-b91468b6d01e",
                                                "sense_id": "9f54ef25-5943-3114-b9f0-924307d33fd3",
                                                "text": "No points were used by the ancient printers, excepting the colon and the period; but, after some time, a short oblique stroke, called a virgil, was introduced, which answered to the modern comma. In the fifteenth century this punctuation was improved by the famous Aldus Manutius with the typographical art in general; when he gave a better shape to the comma, added the semicolon, and assigned to the former points more proper places."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ed15dc0e-1540-311d-a08f-7fd7fc7094f3",
                                        "entry_id": "90bc949d-a4b2-33fc-8765-1cd006073279",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A similar-looking subscript diacritical mark."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Romanian"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "56bfdadf-0a04-3590-8e00-e59bba1eb483",
                                        "entry_id": "90bc949d-a4b2-33fc-8765-1cd006073279",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Any of various nymphalid butterflies of the genus Polygonia, having a comma-shaped white mark on the underwings, especially Polygonia c-album and Polygonia c-aureum of North Africa, Europe, and Asia."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3075baf4-755f-4e47-8958-a93da4465c2e",
                                                "sense_id": "56bfdadf-0a04-3590-8e00-e59bba1eb483",
                                                "text": "Commas (Polygonia comma) and Question Marks (Polygonia interrogationis) occur from the Gulf Coast to Canada and west to the Rockies. [...] Question Marks and Commas are handsome butterflies with burnt orange and black markings. [...] On the underside of each hind wing of the Comma is a small, distinctive silver hook that resembles a comma."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cd2df7a6-3538-4230-b03f-9f4bb5434edc",
                                                "sense_id": "56bfdadf-0a04-3590-8e00-e59bba1eb483",
                                                "text": "Other members of this genus that are frequently encountered in the park are the eastern comma (P. comma) and question mark (P. interrogationis)."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3e82c35d-39ce-31a0-8436-2cb2d0439786",
                                        "entry_id": "90bc949d-a4b2-33fc-8765-1cd006073279",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A difference in the calculation of nearly identical intervals by different ways."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b9e06f94-97a9-353c-bdc8-39513ded99cd",
                                        "entry_id": "90bc949d-a4b2-33fc-8765-1cd006073279",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A delimiting marker between items in a genetic sequence."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3e0acba3-237a-38fd-a5b4-f835d4a926cc",
                                        "entry_id": "90bc949d-a4b2-33fc-8765-1cd006073279",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In Ancient Greek rhetoric, a short clause, something less than a colon, originally denoted by comma marks. In antiquity it was defined as a combination of words having no more than eight syllables in all. It was later applied to longer phrases, e.g. the Johannine comma."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "rhetoric"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1a470155-e13c-3216-9f08-b437717e063c",
                                        "entry_id": "90bc949d-a4b2-33fc-8765-1cd006073279",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A brief interval."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "comma",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b06042b7-0d1c-3510-ad00-11f4e0bd8213",
